{"articleNo":"1542","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1542&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 정시모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.12.14","hit":"16344","attachments":[{"name":"2011학년도 정시 모집요강(최종본).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1542&attachNo=71067"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◎ 2011학년도 정시 모집 지원시 유의사항 ◎&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 원서접수기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010. 12. 18(토) 09:00 ～ 23(목) 18:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 인터넷으로만 원서접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 원서접수처</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 유웨이(www.uwayapply.com)&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><a href=\"http://ipsi7.uwayapply.com/susi2/kumoh/?CHA=1\"></a></span> <a href=\"http://ipsi11.uwayapply.com/jung/kumoh/?CHA=1\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://wwwimg.uwayapply.com/BANNER/APPLY/IMG/banner_43_1_1.gif\"></a>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 진학사(www.jinhakapply.com)&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <a href=\"http://www.jinhakapply.com/frame103826.aspx\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://admin.jinhakapply.com/Banner/j0_ap_mv4.gif\"></a>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">수능성적 반영방법 </span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 일반학생 및 농․어촌학생 전형 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 모든 모집단위(단, 경영학과 제외) : 수리 지정 및&nbsp;언어, 외국어(영어)&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 및&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;탐구영역(2과목 평균)중 우수한 2개 영역 반영</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 경영학과 : 외국어(영어) 지정 및&nbsp;언어, 수리 및 탐구영역(2과목 평균)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 중</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;우수한 2개 영역 반영</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 전문계고교 졸업자 전형 : 수능성적 반영 않음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 면접 및 필답고사 없음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 지원자격(일부 발췌)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 농․어촌학생 전형 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">읍․면지역만 농․어촌으로 인정(학생 및 부모)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 전문계고교 졸업자 전형 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학생부 3학년 평균 석차등급이 4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">.5등급 이내</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">인 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 동일계열</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">이라고 인정되는 모집단위</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 17.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -17.5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 수시모집 합격자는 등록하지 않더라도 본교 및 타 대학의 “정시”모집에 지원할 수 없음</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
